  "description": "**Forest Sirens**\n\nAokigahara Forest in Japan, also known as “the Sea of Trees” or “the Suicide Forest”… A man loses his life there, as if guided by mysterious creatures. Some time later, Kai, his younger brother, arrives on the scene, determined to uncover the reasons behind his disappearance. But as he ventures deeper into the heart of the forest, the place seems to transform… What if an encounter between a human and a mermaid could influence the future of the world?\n\n*Source: Glénat, Vol. 1, translated*",
